proposal = "In programs/crates/layerx-programs-registry/src/lib.rs and src/authority.rs, persist transaction provenance alongside the canonical record and use one explicitly typed identity consistently in admission, replay, read and resolve_deployment. Preserve the separate record digest for integrity, and test resolution of identical verified evidence before and after replay."
